 "body": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\" class=\"no-js\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n    <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, maximum-scale=1, user-scalable=no\">\n    <meta name=\"csrf-token\" content=\"1795715930:SR8kyYCM+ywyg0XSu4aFWKLxt8O0TbheaBara6buyWU=\">\n    <meta name=\"renderer\" content=\"webkit\">\n    <script>\n        window.__feInitLocalTime = new Date().getTime() / 1000;\n        window.__feConfigVersion = '74d532c6c7861bfe'; window.__feConfigRequest = '\\/_lfe\\/config'; window.__fePhoneHomeCall = 'https\\u003A\\/\\/moshimoshi\\u003Aagltb3noatpwohhuenb5ag1tc2jsnnl3\\u0040errtrack.luogu.com.cn\\/lotlp1';        window.__luoguTagVersion = 'zh\\u002DCN\\/2026112601'; window.__luoguTagRequest = '\\/_lfe\\/tags';\n    </script>\n    <title>小A点菜-01背包问题 - 洛谷专栏</title>\n    <link rel=\"icon\" href=\"https://fecdn.luogu.com.cn/favicon.ico\">\n    <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Security-Policy\" content=\"default-src 'unsafe-eval' 'unsafe-inline' luogu.com *.luogu.com luogu.com.cn *.luogu.com.cn luogu.org *.luogu.org wss: blob: luoguprivate.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com luogu.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com https://challenges.cloudflare.com https://*.dun.163yun.com https://*.dun.163.com https://*.nosdn.126.net https://*.nosdn.127.net https://nos.netease.com https://cstaticdun.126.net https://cstaticdun1.126.net https://cstaticdun-v6.126.net https://acstatic-dun.126.net; img-src * data:; font-src * data:; worker-src data: blob:; frame-src https://fecdn.luogu.com.cn https://player.bilibili.com https://www.bilibili.com https://challenges.cloudflare.com\">\n        <script id=\"lentille-context\" type=\"application/json\">{\"instance\":\"main\",\"template\":\"article.show\",\"status\":200,\"locale\":\"zh-CN\",\"data\":{\"article\":{\"lid\":\"2yru0rav\",\"title\":\"\\u5c0fA\\u70b9\\u83dc-01\\u80cc\\u5305\\u95ee\\u9898\",\"category\":2,\"time\":1749226305,\"author\":{\"uid\":1499011,\"avatar\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn.luogu.com.cn\\/upload\\/usericon\\/1499011.png\",\"name\":\"john_01\",\"slogan\":\"\\u6211\\u6e05\\u695a\\u5730\\u770b\\u89c1\\u4f60\\u3002\",\"badge\":null,\"isAdmin\":false,\"isBanned\":false,\"color\":\"Blue\",\"ccfLevel\":0,\"xcpcLevel\":0,\"background\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn.luogu.com.cn\\/upload\\/image_hosting\\/gh2432ti.png\"},\"upvote\":0,\"replyCount\":0,\"favorCount\":0,\"status\":2,\"solutionFor\":{\"pid\":\"P1164\",\"type\":\"P\",\"name\":\"\\u5c0f A \\u70b9\\u83dc\",\"difficulty\":2,\"fullScore\":100},\"promoteStatus\":0,\"collection\":null,\"content\":\"### \\u9898\\u610f\\uff1a\\u6709\\u4e0d\\u7b97\\u591a\\u9053\\u7684\\u83dc\\u548c\\u4e00\\u4e9b\\u94b1\\uff0c\\u8981\\u6c42\\u80fd\\u591f\\u521a\\u597d\\u82b1\\u5149\\u8fd9\\u4e9b\\u94b1\\u7684\\u70b9\\u83dc\\u65b9\\u6848\\u6570\\u3002\\n\\n### \\u601d\\u8def\\n\\n\\u7531\\u4e8e\\u6bcf\\u9053\\u83dc\\u53ef\\u4ee5\\u9009\\u62e9\\u70b9\\u6216\\u4e0d\\u70b9\\uff0c\\u6700\\u540e\\u8981\\u6c42\\u82b1\\u5149\\u4e00\\u5b9a\\u94b1\\u6570\\u7684\\u7684\\u70b9\\u83dc\\u65b9\\u6848\\u6570\\uff0c\\u56e0\\u6b64\\u53ef\\u4ee5\\u91c7\\u752801\\u80cc\\u5305\\u95ee\\u9898\\u7684\\u505a\\u6cd5\\u3002\\n\\n### \\u7b97\\u6cd5\\n\\n1. \\u901a\\u8fc7f\\u6765\\u8bb0\\u5f55\\u5bf9\\u4e8e\\u524di\\u9053\\u83dc\\u548c\\u82b1\\u4e86j\\u5143\\u7684\\u72b6\\u6001\\u6765\\u8bb0\\u5f55\\u65b9\\u6848\\u6570\\u3002\\n\\n2. \\u63a5\\u7740\\u5bf9\\u4e8e\\u6bcf\\u4e00\\u9053\\u83dc\\u7684\\u4ef7\\u94b1\\u53ef\\u4ee5\\u4e0ej\\u8fdb\\u884c\\u6bd4\\u8f83\\u4ece\\u800c\\u5f97\\u5230\\u4e0d\\u540c\\u7684\\u72b6\\u6001\\u8f6c\\u79fb\\u65b9\\u7a0b\\u3002\\n\\n```\\n#include\\u003Cbits\\/stdc++.h\\u003E\\nusing namespace std;\\n\\nconst int N=110,M=10010;\\n\\nint f[N][M],n,m,a[N];\\n\\nint main() {\\n    cin\\u003E\\u003En\\u003E\\u003Em;\\n    for(int i=1;i\\u003C=n;i++) cin\\u003E\\u003Ea[i];\\n    for(int i=1;i\\u003C=n;i++)\\n        for(int j=0;j\\u003C=m;j++) {\\n\\/\\/ j\\u548c\\u5f53\\u524d\\u83dc\\u54c1\\u7684\\u4ef7\\u94b1\\u76f8\\u7b49\\uff0c\\u56e0\\u6b64\\u72b6\\u6001\\u7b49\\u4e8e\\u4e0d\\u9009\\u5f53\\u524d\\u83dc\\u54c1\\u7684\\u65b9\\u6848\\u6570+\\u53ea\\u9009\\u5f53\\u524d\\u83dc\\u54c1\\u7684\\u8fd9\\u4e00\\u4e2a\\u65b9\\u6848\\n            if(j==a[i]) f[i][j]=f[i-1][j]+1;\\n\\/\\/ \\u5f53\\u524d\\u72b6\\u6001\\u7b49\\u4e8e\\u4e0d\\u9009\\u5f53\\u524d\\u83dc\\u54c1\\u7684\\u65b9\\u6848\\u6570\\u52a0\\u4e0a\\u9009\\u7684\\u65b9\\u6848\\u6570\\n            if(j\\u003Ea[i]) f[i][j]=f[i-1][j]+f[i-1][j-a[i]];\\n\\/\\/ \\u6ca1\\u5f97\\u9009\\n            if(j\\u003Ca[i]) f[i][j]=f[i-1][j];\\n        }\\n    cout\\u003C\\u003Cf[n][m];\\n    return 0;\\n}\\n```\\n\\n### \\u603b\\u7ed3\\n\\n- \\u6bcf\\u9053\\u83dc\\u7684\\u72b6\\u6001\\u53ea\\u6709\\u4e24\\u79cd\\uff1a\\u9009\\u6216\\u4e0d\\u9009 \\u5bf9\\u5e94\\u4e8e 01\\u80cc\\u5305\\u95ee\\u9898\\uff0c \\u8981\\u5b66\\u4f1a\\u8bc6\\u522b\\u3002\\n  \\n- \\u6839\\u636e\\u9898\\u76ee\\u4e2d\\u7269\\u54c1\\u7684\\u6027\\u8d28\\uff0c\\u5f97\\u5230\\u72b6\\u6001\\u7684\\u8868\\u793a\\u65b9\\u6cd5\\uff0c\\u5728\\u8be5\\u9898\\u4e2d\\u6bcf\\u4e00\\u79cd\\u72b6\\u6001\\u53ef\\u4ee5\\u4f7f\\u7528\\u70b9\\u83dc\\u7684\\u987a\\u5e8f\\u548c\\u82b1\\u7684\\u91d1\\u989d\\u6765\\u8bb0\\u5f55\\u3002\\n\\n- \\u72b6\\u6001\\u8f6c\\u79fb\\u65b9\\u7a0b\\u8981\\u80fd\\u591f\\u5199\\u51fa\\u6765\\uff0c\\u53ef\\u80fd\\u5206\\u591a\\u949f\\u4e0d\\u540c\\u7684\\u60c5\\u51b5\\uff0c\\u6240\\u4ee5\\u8981\\u6e05\\u6670\\u5730\\u77e5\\u9053\\u72b6\\u6001\\u662f\\u7531\\u4ec0\\u4e48\\u6765\\u8fdb\\u884c\\u8bb0\\u5f55\\u548c\\u72b6\\u6001\\u8868\\u793a\\u5730\\u662f\\u4ec0\\u4e48\\u3002\",\"contentFull\":true,\"adminNote\":null},\"favored\":false,\"voted\":null,\"canReply\":false,\"canEdit\":false},\"user\":null,\"time\":1795629530.94756}</script>            <script src=\"https://fecdn.luogu.com.cn/columba/loader.20261113-2335.js\" charset=\"utf-8\" defer></script>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fecdn.luogu.com.cn/columba/loader.20261113-2335.css\" />\n    <script src=\"https://fecdn.luogu.com.cn/columba/vendor.20261113-2335.js\" charset=\"utf-8\" defer></script>\n        <link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://www.luogu.com/article/2yru0rav\" />\n    <script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Article\",\"name\":\"\\u5c0fA\\u70b9\\u83dc-01\\u80cc\\u5305\\u95ee\\u9898\",\"description\":\"\\u9898\\u610f\\uff1a\\u6709\\u4e0d\\u7b97\\u591a\\u9053\\u7684\\u83dc\\u548c\\u4e00\\u4e9b\\u94b1\\uff0c\\u8981\\u6c42\\u80fd\\u591f\\u521a\\u597d\\u82b1\\u5149\\u8fd9\\u4e9b\\u94b1\\u7684\\u70b9\\u83dc\\u65b9\\u6848\\u6570\\u3002\\n\\u601d\\u8def\\n\\u7531\\u4e8e\\u6bcf\\u9053\\u83dc\\u53ef\\u4ee5\\u9009\\u62e9\\u70b9\\u6216\\u4e0d\\u70b9\\uff0c\\u6700\\u540e\\u8981\\u6c42\\u82b1\\u5149\\u4e00\\u5b9a\\u94b1\\u6570\\u7684\\u7684\\u70b9\\u83dc\\u65b9\\u6848\\u6570\\uff0c\\u56e0\\u6b64\\u53ef\\u4ee5\\u91c7\\u752801\\u80cc\\u5305\\u95ee\\u9898\\u7684\\u505a\\u6cd5\\u3002\\n\\u7b97\\u6cd5\\n\\n\\n\\u901a\\u8fc7f\\u6765\\u8bb0\\u5f55\\u5bf9\\u4e8e\\u524di\\u9053\\u83dc\\u548c\\u82b1\\u4e86j\\u5143\\u7684\\u72b6\\u6001\\u6765\\u8bb0\\u5f55\\u65b9\\u6848\\u6570\\u3002\\u2026\",\"genre\":\"\\u9898\\u89e3\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"john_01\"},\"datePublished\":\"2025-06-07T00:11:45+08:00\"}</script>\n    <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"小A点菜-01背包问题\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"题意：有不算多道的菜和一些钱，要求能够刚好花光这些钱的点菜方案数。\n思路\n由于每道菜可以选择点或不点，最后要求花光一定钱数的的点菜方案数，因此可以采用01背包问题的做法。\n算法\n\n\n通过f来记录对于前i道菜和花了j元的状态来记录方案数。…\" />\n    <meta property=\"article:section\" content=\"题解\" />\n    <meta property=\"article:author\" content=\"john_01\" />\n    <meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2025-06-07T00:11:45+08:00\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.luogu.com/article/2yru0rav\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"洛谷专栏\" />\n        <script id=\"luogu-theme\" type=\"application/json\">{\"id\":1,\"lNavi\":{\"back\":\"#ffffff\",\"fore\":\"#262626\",\"logo\":null},\"lBody\":{\"back\":\"#f0f4fa\",\"blur\":1000,\"fade\":1000,\"image\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn.luogu.com.cn\\/images\\/bg\\/fe\\/luogu4-bg-l.jpg\",\"midOpts\":{\"size\":\"cover\"}},\"dNavi\":{\"back\":\"#1d2025\",\"fore\":\"#ffffff\",\"logo\":\"#ffffff\"},\"dBody\":{\"back\":\"#0d1018\",\"blur\":1000,\"fade\":1000,\"image\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn.luogu.com.cn\\/images\\/bg\\/fe\\/luogu4-bg-d.jpg\",\"midOpts\":{\"size\":\"cover\"}}}</script>\n    <style></style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div id=\"app\">\n    <noscript>\n        <h3>请<b style=\"color:#f00;\">不要禁用</b>脚本，否则网页无法正常加载</h3>\n    </noscript>\n        <article>\n        <h1>小A点菜-01背包问题</h1>\n        <p style=\"font-size: .75em;\">\n            <a rel=\"author\">john_01</a>\n            ·\n            <time datetime=\"2025-06-07T00:11:45+08:00\">2025-06-07 00:11:45</time>\n            ·\n            <a href=\"/article?category=2\">题解</a>\n        </p>\n\n        <h3>题意：有不算多道的菜和一些钱，要求能够刚好花光这些钱的点菜方案数。</h3>\n<h3>思路</h3>\n<p>由于每道菜可以选择点或不点，最后要求花光一定钱数的的点菜方案数，因此可以采用01背包问题的做法。</p>\n<h3>算法</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>通过f来记录对于前i道菜和花了j元的状态来记录方案数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>接着对于每一道菜的价钱可以与j进行比较从而得到不同的状态转移方程。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<pre><code>#include&lt;bits/stdc++.h&gt;\nusing namespace std;\n\nconst int N=110,M=10010;\n\nint f[N][M],n,m,a[N];\n\nint main() {\n    cin&gt;&gt;n&gt;&gt;m;\n    for(int i=1;i&lt;=n;i++) cin&gt;&gt;a[i];\n    for(int i=1;i&lt;=n;i++)\n        for(int j=0;j&lt;=m;j++) {\n// j和当前菜品的价钱相等，因此状态等于不选当前菜品的方案数+只选当前菜品的这一个方案\n            if(j==a[i]) f[i][j]=f[i-1][j]+1;\n// 当前状态等于不选当前菜品的方案数加上选的方案数\n            if(j&gt;a[i]) f[i][j]=f[i-1][j]+f[i-1][j-a[i]];\n// 没得选\n            if(j&lt;a[i]) f[i][j]=f[i-1][j];\n        }\n    cout&lt;&lt;f[n][m];\n    return 0;\n}</code></pre>\n<h3>总结</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>每道菜的状态只有两种：选或不选 对应于 01背包问题， 要学会识别。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>根据题目中物品的性质，得到状态的表示方法，在该题中每一种状态可以使用点菜的顺序和花的金额来记录。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>状态转移方程要能够写出来，可能分多钟不同的情况，所以要清晰地知道状态是由什么来进行记录和状态表示地是什么。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n    </article>\n</div>\n<script>(function(){function c(){var b=a.contentDocument||(a.contentWindow&&a.contentWindow.document);if(b){var d=b.createElement('script');d.innerHTML=\"window.__CF$cv$params={r:'a6028b352ace2db6',t:'MTc5NTYyOTUzMA=='};var l=window.parent.location,o;try{o=new URL(l.origin).origin}catch(e){try{o=new URL(new URL(l.href).origin).origin}catch(e){o=''}}var u='/cdn-cgi/challenge-platform/scripts/jsd/main.js?ray=a6028b352ace2db6',a=document.createElement('script');a.src=o?new URL(u,o).href:u;document.getElementsByTagName('head')[0].appendChild(a);\";b.getElementsByTagName('head')[0].appendChild(d)}}if(document.body){var a=document.createElement('iframe');a.height=1;a.width=1;a.style.position='absolute';a.style.top=0;a.style.left=0;a.style.border='none';a.style.visibility='hidden';document.body.appendChild(a);if('loading'!==document.readyState)c();else if(window.addEventListener)document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded',c);else{var e=document.onreadystatechange||function(){};document.onreadystatechange=function(b){e(b);'loading'!==document.readyState&&(document.onreadystatechange=e,c())}}}})();</script></body>\n</html>\n",
